@@ -0,0 +1,32 @@
+# Geofence emergency turn — Phase 1
+
+Read [PHASE1_REPORT.md](PHASE1_REPORT.md) for the frozen protocol, measured
+results, limitations, and precise reproduction commands. Run from
+`examples/staleguard` with `/home/kean/miniconda3/envs/scg/bin/python`.
+
+This independent mission uses SCG's existing 50 Hz position PID, 1000 Hz
+PyBullet ground truth, and the existing Numba vehicle/PID prediction model.
+No Mission A source or calibrated data is changed. New output directories must
+not already exist; `smoke --resume` is the only append-to-existing workflow.
+The development CLI caps attempts at 20 seeds and flights at 200 per command,
+uses one simulation worker, and retains the existing 2 GiB memory guardrails.
+
+```sh
+python -m geofence_turn.cli characterize --out geofence_turn/logs/new_characterization
+python -m geofence_turn.cli generate --envelope geofence_turn/logs/new_characterization/envelope.json --out geofence_turn/logs/new_generated --attempts 10
+python -m geofence_turn.cli calibrate --generated geofence_turn/logs/new_generated/generated.json --out geofence_turn/logs/new_development --attempts 10 --target 5
+python -m geofence_turn.cli replay --development geofence_turn/logs/new_development --out geofence_turn/logs/new_replay
+python -m geofence_turn.cli smoke --development geofence_turn/logs/new_development --out geofence_turn/logs/new_smoke --max-trials 80
+python -m geofence_turn.reporting geofence_turn/logs/new_smoke
+```
+
+The characterization does not involve recovery policies. Each candidate reuses
+one frozen radius and world-frame waypoint, and calibration considers D=0 only.
+A separate real nominal rollout supplies the latest possible approval bound by
